                        id="creative-direction-collapse"
                        class="accordion-collapse"
                    >
                        <article>
                            <h2>Creative Direction</h2>
                            <p>Recording Guidelines</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Use bright, natural lighting. No filters.</li>
                                <li>Show the full routine: prepping a fresh device, performing the weekly treatment, and applying the Hair Renewal Serum on an off night.</li>
                                <li>Keep backgrounds clean and uncluttered.</li>
                                <li>In cover photos, always show the device or serum in use (unless agreed otherwise).</li>
                                <li>Close-ups of the device's sterile packaging or the gold-plated needle head make for a strong, credible visual.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </article>
