                        <div class="c-note c-note--info">
                            <p><strong>Tag and mention</strong> @qureskincare #QureSkincare #MicroInfusionProHair #QureHairSystem</p>
                            <p>Include your affiliate or other links provided by Qure in Instagram Stories and content captions. If the link can't be placed in bio, include it in linktr.ee or similar.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

